        <p><seg source="#source-102754-102757">『</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-102757-102778"><rb>梅子</rb><rt>うめこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-102778-102787">さん！</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-102787-102808"><rb>梅子</rb><rt>うめこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-102808-102817">さん！</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-102817-102829"><rb>直</rb><rt>す</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-102829-102835">ぐに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-102835-102859"><rb>手套</rb><rt>てぶくろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-102859-102862">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-102862-102874"><rb>持</rb><rt>も</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-102874-102880">つて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-102880-102892"><rb>來</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-102892-102895">て</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-102895-102919"><rb>頂戴</rb><rt>てうだい</rt></ruby>！』と<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-102928-102940"><rb>云</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-102940-102943">ふ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-102943-102958"><rb>聲</rb><rt>こゑ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-102958-102970">がして、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-102970-102985"><rb>軈</rb><rt>やが</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-102985-102994">てパタ</seg><choice source="#source-102994-103000"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice><seg source="#source-103000-103003">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-103003-103033"><rb>梯子段</rb><rt>はしごだん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-103033-103036">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-103036-103051"><rb>上</rb><rt>のぼ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-103051-103054">る</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-103054-103069"><rb>小</rb><rt>ちひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-103069-103075">さな</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-103075-103099