        <p>『でも、<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-123382-123403"><rb>可愛</rb><rt>かあい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-123403-123406">い</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-123406-123421"><rb>犬</rb><rt>いぬ</rt></ruby>ころだッたわね！』<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-123448-123463"><rb>息</rb><rt>やす</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-123463-123478">まうとして</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-123478-123505"><rb>毛莨</rb><rt>キンポーゲ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-123505-123508">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-123508-123520"><rb>凭</rb><rt>よ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-123520-123523">り</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-123523-123538"><rb>掛</rb><rt>かゝ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-123538-123544">つた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-123544-123559"><rb>時</rb><rt>とき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-123559-123565">に、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-123565-123586"><rb>其葉</rb><rt>そのは</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-123586-123592">の一</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-123592-123610"><rb>枚</rb><rt>まい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-123610-123613">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-123613-123625"><rb>取</rb><rt>と</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-123625-123631">つて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-123631-123646"><rb>扇</rb><rt>あふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-123646-123658">ぎながら</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-123658-123673"><rb>愛</rb><rt>あい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-123673-123685">ちやんが</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-123685-123697"><rb>云</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby>ひました、『<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-123715-123733"><rb>私</rb><rt>わたし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-123733-123736">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-123736-123748"><rb>若</rb><rt>も</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1237