          <p><seg source="#source-134978-134981">『</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-134981-135002"><rb>手足</rb><rt>てあし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-135002-135005">へ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-135005-135017"><rb>貼</rb><rt>は</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-135017-135020">ッ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-135020-135032"><rb>置</rb><rt>と</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-135032-135038">いた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-135038-135062"><rb>膏藥</rb><rt>こうやく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-135062-135065">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-135065-135083"><rb>所爲</rb><rt>せゐ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-135083-135094">で――</seg></p>
          <p style="text-indent: 2em" rend="first-line-indent(2)"><seg source="#source-135094-135103">一</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-135103-135121"><rb>錢</rb><rt>せん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-135121-135124">で</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-135124-135136"><rb>一</rb><rt>ひ</rt></ruby><note type="kunten" subtype="okurigana" rend="superscript" source="#source-135136-135154">ト</note><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-135154-135169"><rb>箱</rb><rt>はこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-135169-135175">――</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-135175-135199"><rb>二箱</rb><rt>ふたはこ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-135199-135211"><rb>賣</rb><rt>う</rt></ruby>ろか？』</p>
