        <p><seg source="#source-151372-151375">『</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-151375-151387"><rb>何</rb><rt>ど</rt></ruby>うだか』と<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-151402-151414"><rb>云</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-151414-151420">つて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-151420-151435"><rb>鳩</rb><rt>はと</rt></ruby>は、『<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-151444-151456"><rb>若</rb><rt>も</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-151456-151459">し</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-151459-151471"><rb>然</rb><rt>さ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-151471-151483">うなら、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-151483-151504"><rb>彼等</rb><rt>かれら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-151504-151507">も</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-151507-151522"><rb>蛇</rb><rt>へび</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-151522-151528">の一</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-151528-151546"><rb>種</rb><rt>しゆ</rt></ruby>だ、さうだらう』</p>
