        <p><seg source="#source-167898-167901">『</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-167901-167925"><rb>後生</rb><rt>ごしやう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-167925-167937">ですから</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-167937-167952"><rb>話</rb><rt>はな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-167952-167958">して</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-167958-167973"><rb>下</rb><rt>くだ</rt></ruby>さい』と<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-167985-167997"><rb>些</rb><rt>や</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-167997-168000">や</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-168000-168021"><rb>改</rb><rt>あらたま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-168021-168027">つて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-168027-168042"><rb>愛</rb><rt>あい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-168042-168054">ちやんが</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-168054-168066"><rb>云</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-168066-168081">ひました、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-168081-168093"><rb>然</rb><rt>さ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-168093-168102">うした</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-168102-168123"><rb>素振</rb><rt>そぶり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-168123-168126">で</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-168126-168141"><rb>話</rb><rt>はな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-168141-168156">しかけても</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-168156-168168"><rb>可</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-168168-168174">いか</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-168174-168186"><rb>何</rb><rt>ど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-168186-168192">うか</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-168192-168210"><rb>全</rb><rt>まつた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-168210-168213">く</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-168213-168228"><rb>解</rb><rt>わか</rt></ruby>らなかつたので、『<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-168255-168273"><rb>何故</rb><