        <p><seg source="#source-192710-192713">『</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-192713-192737"><rb>大方</rb><rt>おほかた</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-192737-192749"><rb>然</rb><rt>さ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-192749-192764">うだらうと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-192764-192779"><rb>思</rb><rt>おも</rt></ruby>つた』と<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-192791-192803"><rb>云</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-192803-192809">つて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-192809-192824"><rb>猫</rb><rt>ねこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-192824-192827">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-192827-192845"><rb>再</rb><rt>ふたゝ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-192845-192848">び</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-192848-192860"><rb>消</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-192860-192863">え</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-192863-192875"><rb>失</rb><rt>う</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-192875-192892">せました。</seg></p>
