rb>同</rb><rt>おな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-203830-203833">じ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-203833-203848"><rb>事</rb><rt>こと</rt></ruby>だ！』</p>
        <p><seg source="#source-203859-203862">『</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-203862-203874"><rb>斯</rb><rt>か</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-203874-203880">うも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-203880-203892"><rb>云</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby>へるさ』と<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-203907-203934"><rb>福鼠</rb><rt>ふくねずみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-203934-203937">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-203937-203958"><rb>附言</rb><rt>つけた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-203958-203973">しました、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-203973-203988"><rb>宛</rb><rt>まる</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-203988-203991">で</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-203991-204012"><rb>寢言</rb><rt>ねごと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-204012-204018">でも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-204018-204030"><rb>云</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby>ふやうに、『「<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-204051-204069"><rb>私</rb><rt>わたし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-204069-204072">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-204072-204087"><rb>眠</rb><rt>ねむ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-204087-204093">つて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-204093-204105"><rb>居</rb><rt>ゐ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-204105-204108">る</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-204108-204120"><rb>間</rb><rt>ま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-204120-204123">も</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-204123-204141"><rb>呼吸</rb><rt>いき</rt></ruby>をしてる」と<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-204159-204171"><rb>云</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby>つても、「<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-204186-204204"><rb>私</rb><rt>わたし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-204204-204207">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-204207-204225"><rb>呼吸</rb><rt>いき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-204225-204237">をしてる</seg><ruby type="furigana" re