        <p>『それはお<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-204356-204371"><rb>前</rb><rt>まへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-204371-204374">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-204374-204389"><rb>同</rb><rt>おな</rt></ruby>じことだ』と<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-204407-204434"><rb>帽子屋</rb><rt>ばうしや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-204434-204437">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-204437-204449"><rb>云</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-204449-204473">ひました、これで</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-204473-204494"><rb>談話</rb><rt>はなし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-204494-204509">はぱつたり</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-204509-204521"><rb>止</rb><rt>や</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-204521-204530">んで、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-204530-204542"><rb>其</rb><rt>そ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-204542-204545">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-204545-204572"><rb>連中</rb><rt>れんぢゆう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-204572-204575">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-204575-204596"><rb>霎時</rb><rt>しばし</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-204596-204611"><rb>默</rb><rt>だま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-204611-204617">つて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-204617-204632"><rb>坐</rb><rt>すわ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-204632-204638">つて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-204638-204650"><rb>居</rb><rt>ゐ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-204650-204662">ました、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-204662-204689"><rb>其間</rb><rt>そのあひだ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-204689-204704"><rb>愛</rb><rt>あい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-204704-204716">ちやんは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-204716-204752"><rb>嘴太鴉</rb><rt>はしぶとがらす</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-204752-204770">と、それから</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-204770-204785"><rb>多</rb><rt>おほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-204785-204791">くも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-204791-204803"><rb>無</rb><rt>な</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-204803-204812">かつた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-204812-204848"><rb>手習机</rb><rt>てならひづくゑ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-204848-204860">について</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-204860-204875"><rb>想</rb><rt>おも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-204875-204878">ひ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-204878-204893"><rb>起</rb><rt>おこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-204893-204908">したことの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-204908-204932"><rb>數々</rb><rt><seg source="#source-204917-204923">かず</seg><choice source="#source-204923-204929"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice></rt></ruby><seg source="#source-204932-204938">を、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-204938-204962"><rb>繰返</rb><rt>くりかへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-204962-204965">し</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-204965-204989"><rb>繰返</rb><rt>くりかへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-204989-204992">し</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-204992-205010"><rb>考</rb><rt>かんが</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-205010-205027">へました。</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-205030-205057"><rb>帽子屋</rb><rt>ばうしや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-205057-205060">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-205060-205072"><rb>先</rb><rt>ま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-205072-205075">づ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-205075-205087"><rb>其</rb><rt>そ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-205087-205090">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-205090-205114"><rb>沈默</rb><rt>ちんもく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-205114-205117">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-205117-205132"><rb>破</rb><rt>やぶ</rt></ruby>りました。『<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-205150-205174"><rb>何日</rb><rt>いくにち</rt></ruby>だね？』と<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-205189-205201"><rb>云</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-205201-205207">つて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-205207-205222"><rb>愛</rb><rt>あい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-205222-205234">ちやんの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-205234-205249"><rb>方</rb><rt>はう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-205249-205252">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-205252-205273"><rb>振向</rb><rt>ふりむ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-205273-205279">き、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-205279-205303"><rb>衣嚢</rb><rt>ポケツト</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-205303-205309">から</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-205309-205330"><rb>時計</rb><rt>とけい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-205330-205333">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-205333-205345"><rb>取</rb><rt>と</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-205345-205348">り</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-205348-205360"><rb>出</rb><rt>だ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-205360-205366">し、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-205366-205387"><rb>不安</