        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-205575-205590"><rb>愛</rb><rt>あい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-205590-205602">ちやんは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-205602-205620"><rb>暫</rb><rt>しばら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-205620-205623">く</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-205623-205641"><rb>考</rb><rt>かんが</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-205641-205653">へてから</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-205653-205665"><rb>云</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby>ひました、『四<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-205686-205701"><rb>日</rb><rt>か</rt></ruby>』</p>
        <p>『二<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-205712-205727"><rb>日</rb><rt>か</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-205727-205742"><rb>違</rb><rt>ちが</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-205742-205757">つてる！と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-205757-205784"><rb>帽子屋</rb><rt>ばうしや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-205784-205787">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-205787-205814"><rb>長太息</rb><rt>ためいき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-205814-205817">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-205817-205829"><rb>吐</rb><rt>つ</rt></ruby>きました。『<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-205847-205868"><rb>牛酪</rb><rt>バター</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-205868-205871">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-205871-205886"><rb>役</rb><rt>やく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-205886-205889">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-205889-205901"><rb>立</rb><rt>た</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-205901-205916">たないとお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-205916-205931"><rb>前</rb><rt>まへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-205931-205934">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-205934-205946"><rb>云</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-205946-205952">ふて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-205952-205964"><rb>置</rb><rt>お</rt></ruby>いたぢやないか！』と<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-205994-206006"><rb>言</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-206006-206021">ひたして、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-206021-206045"><rb>腹立</rb><rt>はらだた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-206045-206057">しげに三</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-206057-206090"><rb>月兎</rb><rt>ぐわつうさぎ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-206090-206093">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-206093-206108"><rb>方</rb><rt>はう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-206108-206111">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-206111-206123"><rb>見</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-206123-206137">ました。</seg></p>
        <p>『それは<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-206149-206176"><rb>上等</rb><rt>じやうとう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-206176-206179">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-206179-206200"><rb>牛酪</rb><rt>バター</rt></ruby>でした』と三<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-206218-206251"><rb>月兎</rb><rt>ぐわつうさぎ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-206251-206254">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-206254-206272"><rb>優</rb><rt>おとな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-206272-206284">しやかに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-206284-206299"><rb>答</rb><rt>こた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-206299-206316">へました。</seg></p>
