</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-213942-213945">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-213945-213969"><rb>茶匙</rb><rt>ちやさじ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-213969-213972">で</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-213972-213984"><rb>指</rb><rt>さ</rt></ruby>して）――『それは<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-214011-214032"><rb>心臟</rb><rt>ハート</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-214032-214035">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-214035-214059"><rb>女王</rb><rt>クイーン</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-214059-214062">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-214062-214074"><rb>依</rb><rt>よ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-214074-214080">つて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-214080-214095"><rb>開</rb><rt>ひら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-214095-214104">かれた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-214104-214137"><rb>大會議</rb><rt>だいくわいぎ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-214137-214152">があつて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-214152-214170"><rb>私</rb><rt>わたし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-214170-214173">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-214173-214185"><rb>斯</rb><rt>か</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-214185-214194">ういふ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-214194-214209"><rb>歌</rb><rt>うた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-214209-214212">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-214212-214227"><rb>唄</rb><rt>うた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-214227-214233">つた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-214233-214248"><rb>時</rb><rt>とき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-214248-214259">でした</seg></p>
