        <p>『お<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-226767-226782"><rb>前</rb><rt>まへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-226782-226785">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-226785-226812"><rb>水井戸</rb><rt>みづゐど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-226812-226818">から</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-226818-226833"><rb>水</rb><rt>みづ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-226833-226836">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-226836-226848"><rb>汲</rb><rt>く</rt></ruby>むだらう』と<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-226866-226893"><rb>帽子屋</rb><rt>ばうしや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-226893-226896">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-226896-226908"><rb>云</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby>つて、『それで<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-226929-226944"><rb>解</rb><rt>わか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-226944-226965">るぢやないか、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-226965-227001"><rb>糖蜜井戸</rb><rt>たうみつゐど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-227001-227010">からは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-227010-227034"><rb>糖蜜</rb><rt>たうみつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-227034-227037">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-227037-227049"><rb>汲</rb><rt>く</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-227049-227094">めるサ――え、さうぢやないか、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-227094-227112"><rb>莫迦</rb><rt>ばか</rt></ruby>な？』</p>
