        <p><seg source="#source-228379-228382">『</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-228382-228400"><rb>何故</rb><rt>なぜ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-228400-228406">ネの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-228406-228418"><rb>字</rb><rt>じ</rt></ruby>のつくものばかり？』と<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-228451-228466"><rb>愛</rb><rt>あい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-228466-228478">ちやんが</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-228478-228490"><rb>云</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-228490-228507">ひました。</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-228507-228510">『</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-228510-228528"><rb>何故</rb><rt>なぜ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-228528-228555">、それでないのぢや</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-228555-228573"><rb>不可</rb><rt>いけ</rt></ruby>ないか？』と三<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-228594-228627"><rb>月兎</rb><rt>ぐわつうさぎ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-228627-228630">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-228630-228642"><rb>云</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-228642-228659">ひました。</seg></p>
