        <p>『まア、<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-229523-229541"><rb>私</rb><rt>わたし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-229541-229544">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-229544-229556"><rb>訊</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby>くの』と<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-229568-229583"><rb>愛</rb><rt>あい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-229583-229601">ちやんはさも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-229601-229625"><rb>迷惑</rb><rt>めいわく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-229625-229634">さうに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-229634-229646"><rb>云</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby>つて、『<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-229658-229676"><rb>私</rb><rt>わたし</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-229676-229688"><rb>知</rb><rt>ゝ</rt></ruby>らなくつてよ――』</p>
