        <p>『まア、<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-274166-274181"><rb>何</rb><rt>なん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-274181-274190">といふ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-274190-274205"><rb>嬉</rb><rt>うれ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-274205-274229">しいことでせう、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-274229-274241"><rb>復</rb><rt>ま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-274241-274244">た</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-274244-274256"><rb>逢</rb><rt>あ</rt></ruby>つたのねえ！』<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-274277-274289"><rb>云</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-274289-274295">つて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-274295-274337"><rb>公爵夫人</rb><rt>こうしやくふじん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-274337-274340">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-274340-274361"><rb>可愛</rb><rt>かあい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-274361-274367">さの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-274367-274382"><rb>餘</rb><rt>あま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-274382-274388">り、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-274388-274406"><rb>腕</rb><rt>かひな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-274406-274409">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-274409-274427"><rb>腕</rb><rt>かひな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-274427-274430">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-274430-274442"><rb>觸</rb><rt>ふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-274442-274460">れるばかりに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-274460-274481"><rb>摺寄</rb><rt>すりよ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-274481-274490">つて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-274490-274511"><rb>二人</rb><rt>ふたり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-274511-274517">は一</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-274517-274535"><rb>緒</rb><rt>しよ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-274535-274538">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-274538-274553"><rb>