        <p><seg source="#source-287415-287418">『</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-287418-287439"><rb>競技</rb><rt>ゲーム</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-287439-287442">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-287442-287457"><rb>參</rb><rt>まゐ</rt></ruby>れ』と<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-287466-287499"><rb>女王樣</rb><rt>ぢよわうさま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-287499-287502">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-287502-287517"><rb>愛</rb><rt>あい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-287517-287529">ちやんに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-287529-287544"><rb>申</rb><rt>まを</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-287544-287562">されました、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-287562-287577"><rb>愛</rb><rt>あい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-287577-287589">ちやんは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-287589-287607"><rb>驚</rb><rt>おどろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-287607-287613">きの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-287613-287628"><rb>餘</rb><rt>あま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-287628-287631">り</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-287631-287655"><rb>一言</rb><rt>ひとこと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-287655-287661">をも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-287661-287673"><rb>云</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-287673-287676">ひ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-287676-287688"><rb>得</rb><rt>え</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-287688-287712">ませんでしたが、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-287712-287727"><rb>徐</rb><rt>しづ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-287727-287733">かに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-287733-287745"><rb>其</rb><rt>そ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-287745-287748">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-287748-287763"><rb>後</rb><rt>あと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-287763-287766">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" sou