        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-291821-291842"><rb>彼等</rb><rt>かれら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-291842-291845">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-291845-291860"><rb>直</rb><rt>たゞ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-291860-291884">ちにグリフォン（</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-291884-291923"><rb>鷲頭獅身</rb><rt>しうとうしゝん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-291923-291926">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-291926-291953"><rb>怪物</rb><rt>くわいぶつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-291953-291959">）の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-291959-291977"><rb>所</rb><rt>ところ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-291977-291980">へ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-291980-291992"><rb>來</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-291992-291998">て、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-291998-292019"><rb>日向</rb><rt>ひなた</rt></ruby><hi rend="bouten 傍点 right" source="#source-292019-292061"><seg source="#source-292019-292028">ぽつこ</seg></hi><note type="sic" source="#source-292061-292115"><seg source="#source-292067-292070">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-292070-292091"><rb>日向</rb><rt>ひなた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-292091-292112">ぽつこ」はママ</seg></note><seg source="#source-292115-292127">しながら</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-292127-292145"><rb>寢込</rb><rt>ねこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-292145-292151">んで</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-292151-292166"><rb>了</rb><rt>しま</rt></ruby>ひました。『<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-292184-292196"><rb>起</rb><rt>お</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-292196-292205">きよ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-292205-292235"><rb>懈惰者</rb><rt>なまけもの</rt></ruby>が』と<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-292244-292256"><rb>云</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-29225