        <p><seg source="#source-298810-298813">『</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-298813-298831"><rb>私</rb><rt>わたし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-298831-298840">どもは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-298840-298855"><rb>小</rb><rt>ちひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-298855-298861">さい</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-298861-298876"><rb>時</rb><rt>とき</rt></ruby>に』と<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-298885-298900"><rb>終</rb><rt>つひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-298900-298903">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-298903-298927"><rb>海龜</rb><rt>うみがめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-298927-298930">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-298930-298945"><rb>續</rb><rt>つゞ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-298945-298960">けました、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-298960-298972"><rb>尚</rb><rt>な</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-298972-298975">ほ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-298975-298999"><rb>折々</rb><rt><seg source="#source-298984-298990">をり</seg><choice source="#source-298990-298996"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice></rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-298999-299014"><rb>少</rb><rt>すこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-299014-299023">しづゝ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-299023-299050"><rb>歔欷</rb><rt>すゝりなき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-299050-299056">して</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-299056-299068"><rb>居</rb><rt>ゐ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-299068-299086">たけれども、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-299086-299104"><rb>以前</rb><rt>まへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-299104-299113">よりは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-299113-299134"><rb>沈着</rb><rt>おちつ</rt></ruby>いて、『<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-299146-299164"><rb>私</rb><rt>わたし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-299164-299173">どもは</seg><ru