        <div>
          <head n="2" source="#source-310376-310505"><seg source="#source-310411-310422">第十章</seg><seg source="#source-310422-310425">　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-310425-310440"><rb>蝦</rb><rt>えび</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-310440-310443">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-310443-310464"><rb>舞踏</rb><rt>ぶたう</rt></ruby></head>
        </div>
