        <p>『それッ！』と<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-338893-338905"><rb>云</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-338905-338935">ひさまグリフォンは、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-338935-338950"><rb>愛</rb><rt>あい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-338950-338962">ちやんの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-338962-338974"><rb>手</rb><rt>て</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-338974-338977">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-338977-338989"><rb>取</rb><rt>と</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-338989-338995">つて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-338995-339010"><rb>急</rb><rt>いそ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-339010-339013">ぎ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-339013-339034"><rb>立去</rb><rt>たちさ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-339034-339049">りました、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-339049-339064"><rb>歌</rb><rt>うた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-339064-339067">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-339067-339082"><rb>終</rb><rt>をは</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-339082-339088">るを</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-339088-339100"><rb>待</rb><rt>ま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-339100-339117">たずして。</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-339117-339120">『</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-339120-339135"><rb>何</rb><rt>なん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-339135-339138">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-339138-339162"><rb>審問</rb><rt>しんもん</rt></ruby>？』<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-339168-339183"><rb>愛</rb><rt>あい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-339183-339195">ちやんは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-339195-339210"><rb>喘</rb><rt>あへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-339210-339213">ぎ</seg><choice source="#source-339213-339219"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-339219-339231"><rb>駈</rb><rt>か</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-339231-339264">けました、グリフォンは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-339264-339279"><rb>只</rb><rt>たゞ</rt></ruby>『それッ！』と<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-339300-339315"><rb>叫</rb><rt>さけ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-339315-339333">んだのみで、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-339333-339357"><rb>益々</rb><rt><seg source="#source-339342-339348">ます</seg><choice source="#source-339348-339354"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice></rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-339357-339372"><rb>速</rb><rt>はや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-339372-339375">く</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-339375-339390"><rb>走</rb><rt>はし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-339390-339405">りました、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-339405-339420"><rb>風</rb><rt>かぜ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-339420-339423">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-339423-339435"><rb>持</rb><rt>も</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-339435-339438">て</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-339438-339450"><rb>行</rb><rt>ゆ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-339450-339453">く</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-339453-339468"><rb>