"#source-342542-342545">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-342545-342563"><rb>悦</rb><rt>よろこ</rt></ruby>んでゐました。『あれが<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-342596-342632"><rb>裁判官</rb><rt>さいばんくわん</rt></ruby>だわ』<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-342641-342656"><rb>愛</rb><rt>あい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-342656-342668">ちやんは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-342668-342695"><rb>獨語</rb><rt>ひとりごと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-342695-342698">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-342698-342710"><rb>云</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-342710-342721">つて、</seg></p>
