        <p><seg source="#source-373782-373785">『</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-373785-373803"><rb>全</rb><rt>まつた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-373803-373806">く</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-373806-373821"><rb>何</rb><rt>なん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-373821-373827">にも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-373827-373842"><rb>存</rb><rt>ぞん</rt></ruby>じません』と<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-373860-373875"><rb>愛</rb><rt>あい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-373875-373889">ちやん。</seg></p>
        <p>『それは<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-373901-373916"><rb>極</rb><rt>きは</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-373916-373922">めて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-373922-373946"><rb>必要</rb><rt>ひつえう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-373946-373949">な</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-373949-373964"><rb>事</rb><rt>こと</rt></ruby>だ』と<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-373973-373997"><rb>王樣</rb><rt>わうさま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-373997-374000">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-374000-374036"><rb>陪審官</rb><rt>ばいしんくわん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-374036-374039">一</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-374039-374057"><rb>同</rb><rt>どう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-374057-374060">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-374060-374078"><rb>顧</rb><rt>かへり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-374078-374084">みて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-374084-374099"><rb>申</rb><rt>まを</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-374099-374117">されました。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-374117-374138"><rb>彼等</rb><rt>かれら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-374138-374141">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-374141-374156"><rb>將</rb><rt>まさ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-374156-374168">にこれを</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-374168-374192"><rb>石盤</rb><rt>せきばん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-374192-374195">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-374195-374207"><rb>書</rb><rt>か</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-374207-374228">きつけんとした</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-374228-374243"><rb>時</rb><rt>とき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-374243-374249">に、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-374249-374276"><rb>白兎</rb><rt>しろうさぎ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-374276-374279">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-374279-374294"><r